Lean’s installed binary is intact, but this sandbox denies the `/proc/<pid>/exe` lookup Lean uses to find its own installation. I’m applying a narrow, local `readlink` compatibility shim under `/tmp/audit-work` that only retries denied process-executable lookups through `/proc/self/exe`; it does not alter the toolchain or any audited input.
