+Conjunct 1:
+∀ (I : SortInt)
+  (h : _andBool_ («_>=Int_» I 2)
+    («_==Int_» («pyMod(_,_)_MPY-INT_Int_Int_Int» I 2) 0) = true),
+  («_+Int_» («_/Int_» I 2) 1 : SortInt) = (triAt I : SortInt)
+
+This is exactly verification.k lines 22-25: the guarded backend-canonical
+even expression I /Int 2 +Int 1 equals triAt(I).
